message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Connected Phone Forensics"
abstract: >-
  Recovers smartphone evidence (USB, Bluetooth, hotspot, Phone Link, iPhone pairing and backups,
  synced messages and calls) from the Windows, macOS and Linux computers a phone was connected to,
  and correlates it into devices with per-record provenance.
